Create a Topic
kafka-topics.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9094  --create --topic topic-test1 --replication-factor 3 --partitions 3 --if-not-exists

List the topic
kafka-topics.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9094  --list topic

Describe the topic
kafka-topics.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --describe --topic topic-test

Produce a message 
kafka-console-producer.sh --topic topic-test --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 

Consume message from the topic
kafka-console-consumer.sh --bootstrap-server 127.0.0.1:9092 --topic topic-test --from-beginning

Kafka Topic Consumergroup
kafka-consumer-groups.sh --all-groups --all-topics --bootstrap-server 127.0.0.1:9092 --describe

How to send key, value messages with the kafka console produce
kafka-console-producer.sh --broker-list localhost:9092 --topic topic-name --property "parse.key=true" --property "key.separator=:"
